<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1">
  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第一集：死于七分钟后</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1"><Text>INT. 即刻购退款风控中心 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>竖屏构图。两排工位延伸进黑暗，只有林简面前的显示器亮着。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>屏幕弹窗：人工复核 / 剩余 07:00。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>订单金额：¥1.00。商品：二手录音笔。卖家：林舟。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简的手停在鼠标上。她点开抽屉，里面是一张寻人启事——同一张脸，同一个名字：失踪九个月。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>退款原因跳出：收货人将在七分钟后死亡。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>附件自动播放。监控画面里，唐策在 B3 服务器间拔出灰色硬盘。白雾喷下，他倒在门边。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>画面时间：01:17。现实时间：01:10。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简拨号。无人接听。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁从暗处走近。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>伪造附件。拒绝，交安全组。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>这个卖家是我弟弟。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁看见寻人启事，伸手去按“拒绝”。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简抓起门卡，先一步冲向电梯。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>手机上，倒计时：06:21。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>又一条卖家消息弹出。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林舟（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>姐，别让他拔硬盘。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第二集：预言成真</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2"><Text>INT. B3 服务器间 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>倒计时：01:42。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简撞开门。唐策正弯腰，从机柜底部拔出灰色硬盘——与视频一模一样。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>放下！</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策回头。天花板喷出白雾。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简扑向墙上的红色应急开关。排风机轰鸣，白雾在唐策脸前被扯向风口。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策跌坐在地，剧烈咳嗽。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你怎么知道？</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简把视频怼到他眼前。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策脸色变了。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>林舟说，工单出现就带走硬盘。别问，别等。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>他在哪？</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策没有回答。他把硬盘塞进外套。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>手机震动。周祁发来权限警告：立即拒绝，逾期自动判责。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>倒计时：00:09。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简看向“批准退款”按钮。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>批了，附件会进外部审计库。谁都删不了。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简按下批准。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>屏幕：镜像建立成功。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卖家消息随即出现。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林舟（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>姐，你救错人了。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简抬头。唐策已经把硬盘抵在她喉前。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第三集：证人改签</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="3"><Text>INT. B3 电梯 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策拖林简进电梯，刷卡。二十七层。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>硬盘里有什么？</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你爸不是心梗。他跑单摔伤，平台把工伤判成个人疾病。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简盯着他。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>改判定阈值的人，是林舟。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简一巴掌打过去。唐策没躲。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>他想翻案。我拿了和解金，没去接他。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>电梯突然停在二十六层和二十七层之间。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>第二张工单弹出。附件视频：唐策把硬盘交给周祁，林简被保安按在墙上。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>退款原因：证人已改签。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁（广播）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>唐策，把硬盘交给我。林简，你还有一次体面退出的机会。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策看向监控摄像头，缓慢举起硬盘。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简拔掉控制面板下方的网线。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>警报响。消防模式启动，轿厢下沉半层，门被强制打开。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策突然把硬盘砸向墙面。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>外壳裂开。里面只有一块配重铁片。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我们都只是他放进视频里的演员。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门外，周祁带着两名保安等着他们。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第四集：真正的证据</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="4"><Text>INT. 二十六层数据走廊 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁让保安退到远处，捡起配重铁片。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>林舟没预测未来。他预演了你们。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简注意到周祁胸前的员工证在闪——执法记录模式。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁压住证件，不让她细看。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你批准工单时，我的远程锁权记录也进了镜像。谢闻会在两点前清库。撤回镜像，我放你们走。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>外部审计镜像不能撤回。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你有紧急纠错权限。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>所以你不是来拿硬盘。你要她替你删操作记录。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁一拳把唐策抵在玻璃上。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简手机响起第三张工单。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>附件里，林舟被反绑在天台广告牌钢架上。谢闻只露出一只戴黑色尾戒的手。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻（视频）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>批准这一单，我让他多活七分钟。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>收货地址：即刻购总部天台。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>现实中，周祁的右手也戴着一枚黑色尾戒。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简抬眼看他。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>视频里的人，是你。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第五集：四十七个一元订单</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="5"><Text>INT. 消防楼梯间 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简、唐策走在前，周祁跟在后面。三个人彼此保持两级台阶的距离。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁摘下尾戒，扔给林简。内圈刻着“运营委员会”。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>谢闻给每个替他签字的人一枚。你爸那份，我签的。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策回身揪住他。林简挡在中间。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>手机连续震动。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一张、五张、十张……四十七张旧工单同时进入复核队列。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>每张一元。每张都附着一名骑手被拒赔的现场记录。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>屏幕警告：连续违规批准将由审核员个人承担赔付，并移交追责。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>四十七笔违规，够你还一辈子。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简边跑边逐张批准。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>批准。镜像建立。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>批准。镜像建立。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>批准。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我让林舟一个人替全家认了九个月的错。够了。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>第四十七张工单没有事故视频，只有父亲林守成的拒赔书。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>判定原因：个人疾病。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>附件音频自动播放。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林守成（录音）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>小简，别怪你弟。他改的是数字，拿数字杀人的是——</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>录音戛然而止。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>天台门后传来上膛声。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第六集：死去九个月的人</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="6"><Text>EXT. 即刻购总部天台 - 夜</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>广告牌照亮空荡天台。钢架上没有林舟，只有一部循环播放视频的手机。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻从水箱后走出，手里是一把信号枪。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>林舟九个月前就死了。城西高架，坠车。是你不肯认尸。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简的脚步第一次停下。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我破解了他的延迟发布器。今晚的消息，是我发的。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他展示后台：四十七张工单的批准人，全是林简。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>天亮以后，新闻只有一个版本——失控审核员伪造材料，盗赔公司资金。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐策低声对林简说。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐策</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>他说得对。我们没有原始硬盘。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>当然没有。真正的硬盘，在周经理手里。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简和唐策同时回头。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁站在天台门边，手里多出那只真正的灰色硬盘。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他抬手，把硬盘递向谢闻。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我只要我的记录消失。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻笑了。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简手机弹出最后一张退款单。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>卖家：周祁。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>退款原因：卧底服务未按约完成。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第七集：谁在演谁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="7"><Text>EXT. 即刻购总部天台 - 连续</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻伸手接硬盘。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁却按下硬盘侧面的按钮。一盏红灯亮起：上传中。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁扯开衣领，员工证背后的执法记录灯持续闪烁。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>周祁</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>第一张镜像建立后，我把访问凭证交给了经侦。刚才的话，再说一遍。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>远处警笛响起。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻举起信号枪，对准林简。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你们谁有干净的手？阈值是林舟改的，字是周祁签的，钱是唐策拿的，单是你批的。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>所以证据里，一个都别删。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻扑向循环播放的手机，按下删除。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>屏幕没有熄灭，反而弹出林舟预存的文字。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林舟（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>退款不是退钱，是把损失退回给制造它的人。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻转身逃向设备平台。腐蚀的检修网格在他脚下断裂。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他半身坠出楼沿，一只手抓住栏杆。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简扑过去，抓住他的手腕。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>拉我上去。我给你林舟最后的视频。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简看着他。手指正在下滑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>切黑。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General"><Text>第八集：人工复核</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="8"><Text>EXT. 即刻购总部天台 - 连续</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简用另一只手扣住安全绳，把谢闻拉回平台。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>谢闻瘫在地上。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>谢闻</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>为什么救我？</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林简</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>审判不是退款。我没有批准权。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>天台门被撞开。经侦人员涌入。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>周祁交出硬盘。唐策摘下自己的员工证，放在硬盘旁边。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简手机上，四十七张工单同时显示：外部证据已接收。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="9"><Text>INT. 监管问询室 - 清晨</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>竖屏里，林简独自坐在桌前。窗外天亮。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>调查员把恢复出的手机递给她。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>调查员</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>没有找到林舟。但这是延迟发布器里最后一段未发送视频。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>视频中，九个月前的林舟坐在早餐摊前。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>林舟（视频）</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>姐，如果你看到这里，说明你终于没有替我点拒绝。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简看完，没有哭。她打开父亲的拒赔工单，点击“重新提交”。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>申请理由栏。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简输入：死亡不是个人疾病，沉默也不是。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>页面弹出：系统将在 07:00 后自动判定。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>林简关掉倒计时，选择“人工复核”。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>屏幕只剩两个字：受理。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她第一次靠回椅背。</Text></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>淡出。</Text></Paragraph>
  </Content>
  <TitlePage>
    <Content>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>七分钟退款</Text></Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>竖屏短剧改编剧本</Text></Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge 社区样片</Text></Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge Showcase · 2026</Text></Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>网站展示终稿</Text></Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>8 集 × 约 2 分钟 / 都市科技悬疑 / PG-13</Text></Paragraph>
